# WARM-ALL calibration cells on the CURRENT dashcam-1f workload (user decision).
# Format: arm n seed tag
#
# PURPOSE, and it is a gate design rather than a convenience. The D151 (6) cost-model gate fails
# because WARM IS CONFOUNDED WITH ARM: arms that rebuild histories go warm and show engine prefix
# reuse (edf 358 gpu beliefs / 512,992 hits, llf 362 / 424,224) while b7 and the hybrids show zero
# of both, so the warm coefficient is fitted on edf and llf alone and applied to arms that never go
# warm. These two cells are the first arm that goes warm and cold under ONE policy, which is what
# identifies the warm regime out of arm.
#
# THESE CELLS ARE THE FIT. The EP-G WARM-ALL cells are the HELD-OUT TEST (D151 (6), D154 (2)), so
# nothing fitted here may be reported as a gate pass. Label these CALIBRATION-1F.
#
# warm-all-lru is the PRIMARY instrument: it warms AHEAD of a question, which became expressible
# only with PATCH 1 (Observation.live_sessions). Proof it is legitimate to queue: all 50 committed
# arms are byte-identical before and after that patch (results/orchestration/live2/v5/
# patch1_byte_identity_proof.json), and with the patch live the arm issues 1,684 prefills against
# b7's 0, so its characteristic decision is non-zero.
#
# warm-all-lru-reactive is the SECOND instrument and is NOT warm-ahead: it slice-builds histories
# that already have a pending question, so the question pays the materialisation and it cannot show
# that warming helps on-time. Its counter is warm_reactive_emitted and must never be summed with a
# warm-ahead count. It is included because a sliced build is the only committed shape that both goes
# warm AND reports engine reuse (72 of 95 positive-telemetry rows are on piece-chaining arms, none
# on an arm that rebuilds whole), so it carries the cost-model signal even where warm-ahead does not.
#
# Run with the belief corrector in its default OBSERVE mode (LIVE2_BELIEF_CORRECTION unset), so
# these cells stay comparable with the rest of the handful. The counters still report:
# belief_corrections_observed_only MUST equal belief_corrections_changed, or the mutation was
# applied and the cell is not an observe cell.
warm-all-lru 16 4 _L3
warm-all-lru-reactive 16 4 _L3
